nt\" role=\"presentation\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"mbox-image\"><div class=\"mbox-image-div\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Tango-nosources.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4e/Tango-nosources.svg/60px-Tango-nosources.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"45\" height=\"45\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4e/Tango-nosources.svg/120px-Tango-nosources.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"48\" /></a></span></div></td><td class=\"mbox-text\"><div class=\"mbox-text-span\">此條目<b>沒有列出任何<a href=\"/wiki/Wikipedia:%E5%88%97%E6%98%8E%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90\" title=\"Wikipedia:列明來源\">參考或來源</a></b>。<span class=\"hide-when-compact\"></span> <small class=\"date-container\"><i>(<span class=\"date\">2023年7月21日</span>)</i></small><span class=\"hide-when-compact\"><br /><small>維基百科所有的內容都應該<a href=\"/wiki/Wikipedia:%E5%8F%AF%E4%BE%9B%E6%9F%A5%E8%AD%89\" title=\"Wikipedia:可供查證\">可供查證</a>。請協助補充<a href=\"/wiki/Wikipedia:%E5%8F%AF%E9%9D%A0%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90\" title=\"Wikipedia:可靠來源\">可靠來源</a>以<a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%A5%BC%E5%B9%B2&amp;action=edit\" href=\"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%A5%BC%E5%B9%B2&amp;action=edit\">改善這篇條目</a>。無法查證的內容可能會因為異議提出而被移除。</small></span></div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div id=\"noteTA-86adef35\" class=\"noteTA\"><div class=\"noteTA-group\"><div data-noteta-group-source=\"module\" data-noteta-group=\"Food\"></div></div><div class=\"noteTA-local\"><div data-noteta-code=\"zh-cn:曲奇; zh-hk:曲奇; zh-tw:曲奇餅;\"></div><div data-noteta-code=\"zh-hans:华夫饼; zh-hk:窩夫; zh-tw:格子鬆餅;\"></div></div></div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95173172\">.mw-parser-output .hatnote{font-size:small}.mw-parser-output div.hatnote{padding-left:2em;margin-bottom:0.8em;margin-top:0.8em}.mw-parser-output .hatnote-notice-img::after{content:\"\\202f \\202f \\202f \\202f \"}.mw-parser-output .hatnote-notice-img-small::after{content:\"\\202f \\202f \"}.mw-parser-output .hatnote+.mw-empty-elt+.hatnote{margin-top:-0.5em}body.skin-minerva .mw-parser-output .hatnote-notice-img,body.skin-minerva .mw-parser-output .hatnote-notice-img-small{display:none}@media print{body.ns-0 .mw-parser-output .hatnote{display:none!important}}</style><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\"><span class=\"noviewer hatnote-notice-img\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wikipedia:%E6%B6%88%E6%AD%A7%E4%B9%89\" title=\"Wikipedia:消歧義\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5f/Disambig_gray.svg/40px-Disambig_gray.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5f/Disambig_gray.svg/60px-Disambig_gray.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"220\" data-file-height=\"168\" /></a></span>此條目介紹的是廣義的餅乾。關於一般Cookie的翻譯，請見「<b><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9B%B2%E5%A5%87\" title=\"曲奇餅\">曲奇餅</a></b>」。關於美國的biscuit，請見「<b><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%AF%94%E5%8F%B8%E5%90%89%E9%BA%B5%E5%8C%85\" title=\"比司吉麵包\">比司吉麵包</a></b>」。</div>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Biscuits_in_Ghana.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7f/Biscuits_in_Ghana.jpg/250px-Biscuits_in_Ghana.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"197\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7f/Biscuits_in_Ghana.jpg/500px-Biscuits_in_Ghana.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1242\" data-file-height=\"978\" /></a><figcaption>一盤餅乾</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>餅乾</b>是一種麵粉製<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%83%98%E7%84%99%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"烘焙技術\">烘焙</a>食品之稱。餅乾形狀各異，並可夾心或在表面裝飾。另外，一些不包含麵粉的烘焙食品如<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%9B%8B%E7%99%BD%E6%9D%8F%E4%BB%81%E9%A4%85\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"蛋白杏仁餅\">蛋白杏仁餅</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E9%A6%AC%E5%8D%A1%E9%BE%8D\" title=\"馬卡龍\">馬卡龍</a>也被稱為餅乾。\n</p>\n<meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" />\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"饼干分类\"><span id=\".E9.A5.BC.E5.B9.B2.E5.88.86.E7.B1.BB\"></span>餅乾分類</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E9%A5%BC%E5%B9%B2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"編輯章節：餅乾分類\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"硬质饼干\"><span id=\".E7.A1.AC.E8.B4.A8.E9.A5.BC.E5.B9.B2\"></span>硬質餅乾</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E9%A5%BC%E5%B9%B2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"編輯章節：硬質餅乾\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>含脂肪（油）少，含水很少。口感硬，一般質地薄脆的英語稱snap。如薑餅和比較厚的義大利脆餅。其中軍用餅乾十分飽腹。\n</p>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Plate_of_biscotti.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"義大利脆餅（biscotti）\"><img alt=\"義大利脆餅（biscotti）\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/24/Plate_of_biscotti.jpg/120px-Plate_of_biscotti.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"80\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/24/Plate_of_biscotti.jpg/250px-Plate_of_biscotti.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1760\" data-file-height=\"1168\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">義大利脆餅（biscotti）</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Freshly_baked_gingerbread_-_Christmas_2004.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"薑餅\"><img alt=\"薑餅\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fa/Freshly_baked_gingerbread_-_Christmas_2004.jpg/120px-Freshly_baked_gingerbread_-_Christmas_2004.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"90\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fa/Freshly_baked_gingerbread_-_Christmas_2004.jpg/250px-Freshly_baked_gingerbread_-_Christmas_2004.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"560\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">薑餅</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Biscuits_with_Chocolate_Sauce_in_Taiwan.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"軍用壓縮餅乾\"><img alt=\"軍用壓縮餅乾\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d4/Biscuits_with_Chocolate_Sauce_in_Taiwan.jpg/120px-Biscuits_with_Chocolate_Sauce_in_Taiwan.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"97\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d4/Biscuits_with_Chocolate_Sauce_in_Taiwan.jpg/250px-Biscuits_with_Chocolate_Sauce_in_Taiwan.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"322\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">軍用壓縮餅乾</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"比司吉\"><span id=\".E6.AF.94.E5.8F.B8.E5.90.89\"></span>比司吉</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E9%A5%BC%E5%B9%B2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"編輯章節：比司吉\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r95173172\" /><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\">主條目：<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%AF%94%E5%8F%B8%E5%90%89%E9%BA%B5%E5%8C%85\" title=\"比司吉麵包\">比司吉麵包</a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%8F%E8%8B%B1%E8%AF%AD\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"美式英語\">美式英語</a>所稱的biscuit，是一種使用<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B0%8F%E8%98%87%E6%89%93%E7%B2%89\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"小蘇打粉\">小蘇打粉</a>或是<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B3%A1%E6%89%93%E7%B2%89\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"泡打粉\">泡打粉</a>為膨發劑所烘焙成的小麵包，做法與口感類似英國的<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8F%B8%E5%BA%B7%E9%A4%85\" title=\"司康餅\">司康餅</a>。\n</p>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Runny_hunny.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"比司吉(biscuit)\"><img alt=\"比司吉(biscuit)\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cc/Runny_hunny.jpg/120px-Runny_hunny.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"79\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cc/Runny_hunny.jpg/250px-Runny_hunny.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1780\" data-file-height=\"2700\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">比司吉(biscuit)</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Biscuit_Rose_de_Reims.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"蘭斯玫瑰餅乾\"><img alt=\"蘭斯玫瑰餅乾\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/50/Biscuit_Rose_de_Reims.jpg/120px-Biscuit_Rose_de_Reims.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"90\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/50/Biscuit_Rose_de_Reims.jpg/250px-Biscuit_Rose_de_Reims.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"3072\" data-file-height=\"2304\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%85%B0%E6%96%AF%E7%8E%AB%E7%91%B0%E9%A5%BC%E5%B9%B2\" title=\"蘭斯玫瑰餅乾\">蘭斯玫瑰餅乾</a></div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"脆饼干\"><span id=\".E8.84.86.E9.A5.BC.E5.B9.B2\"></span>脆餅乾</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E9%A5%BC%E5%B9%B2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"編輯章節：脆餅乾\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>英語稱cracker。由水、麵粉和少量脂肪構成。結構多層並含有空氣，口感鬆脆。如蘇打餅乾和猶太人的<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%84%A1%E9%85%B5%E9%A4%85\" title=\"無酵餅\">無酵餅</a>。<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BD%97%E9%A9%AC%E5%A4%A9%E4%B8%BB%E6%95%99\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"羅馬天主教\">羅馬天主教</a><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%81%96%E9%A4%90%E7%A6%AE\" title=\"聖餐禮\">聖餐禮</a>中使用的特製小圓薄餅屬於此類。\n</p>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Broken-cracker.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"脆餅乾\"><img alt=\"脆餅乾\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8e/Broken-cracker.jpg/120px-Broken-cracker.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"90\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8e/Broken-cracker.jpg/250px-Broken-cracker.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"3264\" data-file-height=\"2448\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">脆餅乾</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Matzah.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"無酵餅是逾越節的傳統食品\"><img alt=\"無酵餅是逾越節的傳統食品\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2e/Matzah.jpg/120px-Matzah.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"106\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2e/Matzah.jpg/250px-Matzah.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"2603\" data-file-height=\"2304\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%84%A1%E9%85%B5%E9%A4%85\" title=\"無酵餅\">無酵餅</a>是<a href=\"/wiki/%E9%80%BE%E8%B6%8A%E7%AF%80\" title=\"逾越節\">逾越節</a>的傳統食品</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"曲奇\"><span id=\".E6.9B.B2.E5.A5.87\"></span>曲奇餅</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E9%A5%BC%E5%B9%B2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"編輯章節：曲奇餅\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r95173172\" /><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\">主條目：<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9B%B2%E5%A5%87\" title=\"曲奇餅\">曲奇餅</a></div>\n<p>又稱甜餅、小西餅，美式英文稱為cookie。含有大量的脂肪和糖，經常使用<a href=\"/wiki/%E9%B8%A1%E8%9B%8B\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"雞蛋\">雞蛋</a>。\n</p>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Chocolate_chip_cookies.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"巧克力曲奇餅（chocolate chip cookies）\"><img alt=\"巧克力曲奇餅（chocolate chip cookies）\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/50/Chocolate_chip_cookies.jpg/120px-Chocolate_chip_cookies.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"87\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/50/Chocolate_chip_cookies.jpg/250px-Chocolate_chip_cookies.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"2206\" data-file-height=\"1606\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">巧克力曲奇餅（chocolate chip cookies）</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"华夫饼\"><span id=\".E5.8D.8E.E5.A4.AB.E9.A5.BC\"></span>格子鬆餅</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E9%A5%BC%E5%B9%B2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"編輯章節：格子鬆餅\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r95173172\" /><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\">主條目：<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8D%8E%E5%A4%AB%E9%A5%BC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"格子鬆餅\">格子鬆餅</a></div>\n<p>又稱煎餅、格子餅。英文稱waffle，漢語稱為華夫餅。系注入特製的模子製成，比較乾燥，疏鬆多孔。捲成錐筒狀的格子鬆餅傳統上用來盛<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%86%B0%E6%B7%87%E6%B7%8B\" title=\"冰淇淋\">冰淇淋</a>。\n</p>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Gaufre_biscuit.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"格子鬆餅\"><img alt=\"格子鬆餅\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6c/Gaufre_biscuit.jpg/120px-Gaufre_biscuit.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"80\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6c/Gaufre_biscuit.jpg/250px-Gaufre_biscuit.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1200\" data-file-height=\"804\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">格子鬆餅</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"鬆饼\"><span id=\".E9.AC.86.E9.A5.BC\"></span>鬆餅</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E9%A5%BC%E5%B9%B2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"編輯章節：鬆餅\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r95173172\" /><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\">主條目：<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9D%BE%E9%A5%BC\" class=\"mw-redirect mw-disambig\" title=\"松餅\">鬆餅</a></div>\n<p>用特製的puff pastry麵團製成，為高筋麵粉製的麵團，包入起酥油類（例如<a href=\"/wiki/%E9%BB%83%E6%B2%B9\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"奶油\">奶油</a>）後多次摺疊。製作出來的餅乾受熱後膨脹，各層分離開來，特別鬆脆。\n</p>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Turnover_001.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"帶餡的三角鬆餅（Turnover）\"><img alt=\"帶餡的三角鬆餅（Turnover）\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/75/Turnover_001.jpg/120px-Turnover_001.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/75/Turnover_001.jpg/250px-Turnover_001.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1371\" data-file-height=\"847\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">帶餡的三角鬆餅（Turnover）</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"柔韧类饼干\"><span id=\".E6.9F.94.E9.9F.A7.E7.B1.BB.E9.A5.BC.E5.B9.B2\"></span>柔韌類餅乾</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E9%A5%BC%E5%B9%B2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"編輯章節：柔韌類餅乾\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>成品含<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B0%B4\" title=\"水\">水</a>和<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%B3%96\" title=\"糖\">糖</a>很多，口感柔韌。例如<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B7%A7%E5%85%8B%E5%8A%9B%E5%B8%83%E6%9C%97%E5%B0%BC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"巧克力布朗尼\">巧克力布朗尼</a>。\n</p>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Chocolate_brownies.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"巧克力布朗尼(brownies)\"><img alt=\"巧克力布朗尼(brownies)\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/35/Chocolate_brownies.jpg/120px-Chocolate_brownies.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"90\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/35/Chocolate_brownies.jpg/250px-Chocolate_brownies.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"2048\" data-file-height=\"1536\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">巧克力布朗尼(brownies)</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"参考资料\"><span id=\".E5.8F.82.E8.80.83.E8.B5.84.E6.96.99\"></span>參考資料</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E9%A5%BC%E5%B9%B2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"編輯章節：參考資料\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95173149\">.mw-parser-output .side-box{margin:4px 0;box-sizing:border-box;border:1px solid #aaa;font-size:88%;line-height:1.25em;background-color:#f9f9f9;display:flow-root}.mw-parser-output .side-box-abovebelow,.mw-parser-output .side-box-text{padding:0.25em 0.9em}.mw-parser-output .side-box-image{padding:2px 0 2px 0.9em;text-align:center}.mw-parser-output .side-box-imageright{padding:2px 0.9em 2px 0;text-align:center}@media(min-width:500px){.mw-parser-output .side-box-flex{display:flex;align-items:center}.mw-parser-output .side-box-text{flex:1}}@media(min-width:720px){.mw-parser-output .side-box{width:238px}.mw-parser-output .side-box-right{clear:right;float:right;margin-left:1em}.mw-parser-output .side-box-left{margin-right:1em}}</style><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95173201\">@media print{body.ns-0 .mw-parser-output .sistersitebox{display:none!important}}</style><div class=\"side-box side-box-right plainlinks sistersitebox\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95173195\">.mw-parser-output .plainlist ol,.mw-parser-output .plainlist ul{line-height:inherit;list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .plainlist ol li,.mw-parser-output .plainlist ul li{margin-bottom:0}</style>\n<div clas